From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Q2 Launcher <engine@q2launcher.invalid>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] web: make OpenAL optional

Honour -Dopenal on web instead of always requiring it; the launcher build has no OpenAL.
---
 meson.build | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index 38ae741..cba5af6 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -528,7 +528,7 @@ if web
   openal = dependency('openal',
     method: 'system',
     fallback: 'openal-soft',
-    required: true,
+    required: get_option('openal'),
   )
 else
   openal = dependency('openal',
